ultra compressed print
.TP
.B \-s
semi compressed print
.TP
.B \-x
expanded print
.TP
.B \-e
elite 12 cps (default)
.TP
.B \-E
elite proportional
.TP
.B \-p
pica 10 cps
.TP
.B \-P
pica proportional
.TP
.B \-d
draft mode quality
.TP
.B \-s
standard quality (default)
.TP
.B \-n
near letter quality
.TP
.B \-6
six lines per inch (default)
.TP
.B \-8
eight lines per inch
.TP
.B \-0
